## 폴더 별 관심 상품 조회

<details>
<summary>sql</summary>

<a id="1c3eda9b0fe181ac9ef0fbfd3ba71b63"></a>

```sql
select
    *
from product p
where p.user_id = 1;


select
    p.id,
    p.title as product_title,
    pf.product_id as product_id,
    pf.folder_id as folder_id
from
    product p left join product_folder pf
        on p.id = pf.product_id
where p.user_id =1
    and
    pf.folder_id = 1
order by p.id desc
    limit 10;
```

</details>
